[{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「真的很谢谢你」","art":{"background":"a1107","sprites":[{"asset":"a139","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「呃、嗯」","art":{"background":"a1108","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"她突然一惊，羞涩地扭起了身子，但似乎并不是准备逃跑。","art":{"background":"a1108","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「嘿……嘿嘿……」","art":{"background":"a1109","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「哼哼。主人，你可以尽情慰劳本座的」","art":{"background":"a1109","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「那就再继续一会儿」","art":{"background":"a1109","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不过，你找得很辛苦吧？」","art":{"background":"a1109","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我也找了找，可实在是什么都找不到，没找多久就想放弃了」","art":{"background":"a1109","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「……主人」","art":{"background":"a1110","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「怎、怎么了啊？」","art":{"background":"a1110","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「什么都找不到是怎么回事？你不是去休息的吗？」","art":{"background":"a618","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊……」","art":{"background":"a618","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「主人，你对本座撒谎了吗？」","art":{"background":"a618","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不，并不是这样……好了好了，冷静点」","art":{"background":"a618","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「哎，啊……主、主人，你太卑鄙了……嘿……嘿嘿……」","art":{"background":"a1111","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"头被我一摸，小雨又喜笑颜开了。","art":{"background":"a1111","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"……有点好玩。","art":{"background":"a1111","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「所以说不要拿本座来玩，主人！」","art":{"background":"a1112","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"}]